through John Phelan, president and general manager of the Sun Kings.
The Tanner-guided Sun Kings finished in the Texas League cellar last season, and
the Angel front office, in taking full blame for the poor finish, has emphasized that a
much stronger team will take the field in the halo caps next April.
“We under-estimated the caliber of team required to win in the Texas League,”
Hemond said at conclusion of the season.” We promise that there will be a real con-
tender in El Paso next season.””


